raph is that Horrors down't like Spawn.<br /> <b>p. 126: </b>&quot;sometimes triggering vicious rivalries and evolutions of the soul that they have no means <b>through which</b> to control or shape.&quot; I am 90% sure those words are not supposed to be there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13641,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","user":"Mad_Maudlin","date":". 03-09-2018, 05:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T15:44:58-08:00","id":1193729,"title":"","content":"p. 32 &quot;...and the closer Beasts grow, the more <b>or</b> their own Chambers they\u2019ll connect with Burrows, until their Lairs become a functionally shared space.&quot;<br /> <br /> Replace &quot;or&quot; with &quot;of&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T16:49:52-08:00","id":1193741,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 62:</b> &quot;The <b>Wendigo </b>haunts North America\u2019s coldest reaches.&quot; -- should be lowercase","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 03-10-2018, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T19:51:16-08:00","id":1193783,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 148: &quot;</b>The character cannot regain Willpower <b>will </b>under the effect of this Trait.&quot; Should be while.<br /> <b>p. 150: </b>&quot;A Dreamquake has a strength rating equal to 10<b> \u2013 </b>the Dreamquake\u2019s duration.&quot; The minus sign is in a black font that barely shows up against the background, rather than the white font of the rest of the sidebar.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13641,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","user":"Mad_Maudlin","date":". 03-09-2018, 11:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13641-mad_maudlin","name":"Mad_Maudlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T13:20:42-08:00","id":1194018,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 29: </b>&quot;<b>An Beast </b>that finds a Chamber at the edge of a cliff...&quot; Should be <b>A Beast</b>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23999-grimscribe","name":"Grimscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T15:44:36-08:00","id":1194066,"title":"","content":"p. 119, Closer to the Horror: &quot;The Beast must spend 1 Satiety per day over two .&quot; It seems unclear whether this means the Beast loses 1 Satiety every consecutive day after the second they spend with the Horrorspawn, or it is a cumulative amount (1 Satiety the third day, 2 Satiety the fourth day, and so on). I interpret it as the former, but it would be nice to get a clarification in the text.<br /> <br /> p. 111. The page includes a table about Horrorspawn Potency and its Time to Decay that seems absolutely unrelated to anything in the page, or the ones immediately before or after. The only possible reference seems to concern the Death and Dying rules on p.119, about what happens if the Horror is killed but the Horrorspawn survives. If this be the case, the table's place looks confusing and should be adjusted in the layout.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","name":"Irioth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"566"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T20:46:12-08:00","id":1194129,"title":"","content":"p. 37 &quot;The Japanese phrase \u201c<b>oni-ni-kanab\u014d</b>,\u201d literally translating to \u201coni with a giant club...\u201d<br /> <br /> p. 45 &quot;<b>M\u0101ori</b> tradition has its own deity birthed from the sea who is devoted to ugly things...&quot;<br /> <br /> The &quot;\u014d&quot; and &quot;\u0101&quot; are displayed as placeholder characters in the PDF.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T23:04:31-08:00","id":1194145,"title":"","content":"p. 48 &quot;<b>However</b>, those creatures also provide the best opportunities to feed. As a result, Talassii try to reach out to those supernatural beings who are mostly human. <b>However</b>, their advances can come on too strong, making these naturally paranoid individuals that much more uncomfortable.&quot;<br /> <br /> Repetitive words. Replace one of the words with a different equivalent, like &quot;Nevertheless...&quot;, &quot;That said...&quot;, &quot;Despite that...&quot;, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T20:53:29-07:00","id":1194433,"title":"","content":"pg. 161: The Dramatic Failure and Failure results for the extended roll seem to be switched.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" bor